{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node-030",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 560,
      "label": "本輪新增／測試的機制（2026-07-29）"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-002",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -70,
      "y": -100,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 780,
      "label": "初始化來源（擇一）"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-003",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Random init**\n\n`ELECTRO_JACOBI_MODE=off`\n\n隨機初始座標",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -40,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-004",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Jacobi 暖啟動**\n（生產預設 replace）\n\nb2b 連線圖做\n20 輪鄰居平均",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-032",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`ELECTRO_MIB_PORTFOLIO=1`**\n\nMIB 統一版當額外候選\n（非無條件套用）\n小幅正貢獻",
      "x": 2300,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-033",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**已測不採用**：`SLICE_WALLS=0`（小贏但不穩健）、`SLICE_BUDGET=1200`（被兩端支配）、`_cut_options` 面積提早否決（等價但只有 1.01×）",
      "x": 1860,
      "y": 1090,
      "width": 840,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-040",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Proxy Cost 排名**\n\n`exp(2·V_rel)·(hpwl/ha + area/aa)`\n錨點跟候選池無關\n（aa = 總面積/0.966）",
      "x": 1230,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-005",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ML 暖啟動**\n（`ELECTRO_ML_INIT=1`）\n\nTransformer 預測\n每個方塊的中心點\n當梯度下降起點",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-011",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stage 2a\n**legalize()**（梯度式）\n\n順序抽取 → 壓實 → `_cleanup` 保底\n\n⚡ `ELECTRO_FAST_CLEANUP=1`\n增量式重掃，只檢查動過的方塊\n**legalize 2.4× 加速**",
      "x": 1230,
      "y": -50,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stage 3\n**soft_repair()**\n\nboundary snap\n+ wide-swap（預設開）\n\ngrouping\npush-past（預設開）",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": -35,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-031",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "⚡ **`ELECTRO_FAST_CLEANUP=1`**\n（本輪最大勝利）\n\n增量式 `_cleanup`\n**真實 Total −12.2%**\n快過中位數 43 → 95 案\n**品質逐位元不變**",
      "x": 1860,
      "y": 810,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-050",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Portfolio 選擇\n\n每個候選都算一次 proxy cost，**逐案挑最低者送出**\n——不是調出單一最佳參數，是同時養一群候選",
      "x": 1175,
      "y": 1440,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-020",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**place-compact**（`ELECTRO_PLACE_COMPACT=1`）\n\n把已壓實佈局的中心點當新初始化，再跑一輪短版 analytical_place → 額外候選\n`PLACE_COMPACT_TOPK=3`：只對 prerank 前 3 名重拍，砍 75% 計算量",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Electro Pipeline 架構圖\n\n**目前主力：`collaborate/electro_v5/`**（隊友 slice_pack 路線 + 本專題的加速/品質機制）\n完整方塊說明見同資料夾 `Electronic_Pipeline.md`。",
      "x": -70,
      "y": -440,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-010",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stage 1\n**analytical_place()**\n\nAdam 梯度下降\n`ELECTRO_ITERS=300`\n（600→300 品質幾乎無損）",
      "x": 630,
      "y": -10,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-060",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 630,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## Stage 2b\n**slice_pack()**（切割式）\n\n面積比例遞迴 guillotine 切割\n軟方塊長寬比自由 → 填充率可近 100%\n\n**貢獻 −25.7%，是主力機制**\n（Otten 1982 切割式佈局）"
    }
  ],
